sentences.text:
The petitioner is directed to be enlarged on bail in Spl.C.C.No.277/2024 pending before the Court of Additional District and Sessions Judge FTSC-I Tumakuru NC:
2024:KHC:50938 arising out of Crime No.42/2024 registered by Huliyar Police Sri. Hanumantha @ Hanumesh vs The State Of Karnataka on 10 December, 2024 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/63798233/
3 Station, Tumakuru District for the offences punishable under Sections 376(2)(n),
376(3), 506 of IPC and Sections 4(2), 6 of the of Protection of Children from sexual Offences Act, 2012, subject to the following conditions:
a) The petitioner shall execute personal bond for a sum of Rs.1,00,000/- (Rupees One Lakh only) with two sureties for the likesum, to the satisfaction of the jurisdictional Court;
b) The petitioner shall appear regularly on all the dates of hearing before the Trial Court unless the Trial Court exempts his appearance for valid reasons;
c) The petitioner shall not directly or indirectly threaten or tamper with the prosecution witnesses;
 d) The petitioner shall not involve in  similar offences in future;
 e) The petitioner shall not leave the  jurisdiction of the Trial Court without  NC: 2024:KHC:50938 permission of the said Court until the case registered against him is disposed off.
Sd/-
(S VISHWAJITH SHETTY) JUDGE KVR Sri. Hanumantha @ Hanumesh vs The State Of Karnataka on 10 December, 2024 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/63798233/
